        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build an unbeatable haunted house of nightmares. In HauntedManager, you'll manage guests, money, and mischievous ghosts while enjoying simple top-down tower defense gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171480/extras/c7bf2c0c16640b0bfd2ceaea16315fc2.avif?t=1778717677\" width=640 height=200 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Description</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You've become the manager of a haunted house!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spook guests and chase them out before they make it to the finish line.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your team of mischievous ghosts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Usher crying guests toward the exit so they don't spoil the experience for others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elite guests from the Main Shrine will come to taunt you. Beat them at their own game and have them join your team. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3171480/extras/8be43802405d8ac30bfc6f119a644bf2.avif?t=1778717677\" width=640 height=120 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime: approximately 4-5 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes an easy mode and a super easy mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn animations </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ghost Staff Members</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doppelganger: Not even she knows who she's a copy of, making her basically just another human.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crasher: An entity that once dominated the world, though now so well-known that no one fears her.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hasshaku: An urban legend of internet origins who doles out physical attacks. Also good at basketball.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And more!</p></li></ul>",
